WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
ONE QUESTION DOES NOT NEED EVERY LESSON. A fictional learner’s topic can change source order without creating personal advice.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
READ THE QUESTION—NOT THE PERSON. Collect no health profile; preserve topic, source date, jurisdiction and unknowns.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
REORDER SOURCES, NOT ANSWERS. Adapt navigation and knowledge checks; do not recommend use, products or doses.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
STOP AT INDIVIDUAL RISK. High-risk or legal questions route to current official or professional help.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
EDUCATION IS NOT CLEARANCE. A dated source cannot determine personal safety, effectiveness, impairment or legality.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
KEEP THE SOURCE AND LIMIT TOGETHER. Every lesson should expose issuer, date, exact section and unresolved uncertainty.
